  "notes": "Still the commonest Transavia scheme in late 2026 (all 737-800s and many A320neo-family aircraft; Transavia France too). The belly marks are a row of colored icons seen only edge-on in these photos: drawn as two plain patches, low confidence. Re-checked 2026-11-15: re-measured on the 737-800 (PH-HXI, two photos, 2026), the type most of the fleet in this scheme flies; the title's lowercase 0.7 of the t; the discs drawn as circles (smooth).",
  "history": "Introduced March 2015 on PH-HZE, replacing the green-and-blue scheme; superseded by the 2025 livery on new deliveries from September 2025.",
